 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "The chief priests met with the Pharisees",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.89,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "They sat in council and asked with care",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.9,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "What are we doing, they questioned deep",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.83,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "This man performs many signs, they said",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.43,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "If he keeps on like this, they feared",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.88,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Everyone will believe in him",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.53,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The Romans will come to take away",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.87,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Both our place and our nation",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.39,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "It is better that one man die",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.64,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "For the people than the whole nation perish",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.7,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "One man die for the people",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.7,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Save us from the end of days",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.69,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "One of them named Caiaphas spoke",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.53,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He was high priest that very year",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.83,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "You know nothing at all, he said",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.88,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "You do not realize the truth",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.67,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "It is better that one man die",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.73,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "For the people than the whole nation perish",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.62,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He did not say this on his own",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.76,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
